            "value": "此裝置沒有 nope. 可使用的相機。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To take photos, turn on camera access for nope. in the Settings app.": {
      "comment": "Explains how to allow camera access after it was declined. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged: it is the app's name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Um Fotos aufzunehmen, aktiviere den Kamerazugriff für nope. in der App „Einstellungen“."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Para tomar fotos, activa el acceso a la cámara para nope. en la app Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Pour prendre des photos, activez l’accès à l’appareil photo pour nope. dans l’app Réglages."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Per scattare foto, attiva l’accesso alla fotocamera per nope. nell’app Impostazioni."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "写真を撮るには、設定アプリで nope. のカメラへのアクセスをオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진을 찍으려면 설정 앱에서 nope.의 카메라 접근을 켜십시오."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zet in de app Instellingen cameratoegang aan voor nope. om foto’s te maken."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Para tirar fotos, ative o acesso à câmera para o nope. no app Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "若要拍照，请在“设置”App 中打开 nope. 的相机访问权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "若要拍照，請在「設定」App 中開啟 nope. 的相機取用權限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
